WEBVTT

00:00:05.264 --> 00:00:07.374
I want to love you more

00:00:07.374 --> 00:00:09.674
I want to give you more love

00:00:09.674 --> 00:00:15.414
I just want to hear your voice

00:00:15.414 --> 00:00:29.094
MAGIKANO

00:00:29.094 --> 00:00:35.134
As I soaked my fruit corn flakes in milk

00:00:35.134 --> 00:00:39.834
I thought about it with bedhair

00:00:41.234 --> 00:00:45.774
In front of the railroad crossing

00:00:45.774 --> 00:00:51.144
You suddenly covered your ears and stopped

00:00:52.144 --> 00:00:54.814
But listen! I want you more

00:00:54.814 --> 00:00:56.354
I want to bring you closer to my heart

00:00:56.354 --> 00:00:59.384
I want to give you more kisses

00:00:59.384 --> 00:01:03.394
I get a little lonely for some reason

00:01:03.394 --> 00:01:05.294
To tell you the truth

00:01:05.294 --> 00:01:06.964
I want to give you more love

00:01:06.964 --> 00:01:08.464
I want to bring you closer to my heart

00:01:08.464 --> 00:01:13.364
So keep your spirits higher

00:01:14.504 --> 00:01:20.514
Your smile is enough to give me a fever

00:01:20.514 --> 00:01:25.774
The fever of happiness is rising

00:01:35.224 --> 00:01:36.394
Did I catch a cold or something?

00:01:36.394 --> 00:01:39.324
Now that I think about it, I feel kinda feverish.

00:01:39.324 --> 00:01:42.064
It's started getting cold lately.

00:01:42.064 --> 00:01:46.904
Oops, I'd better hurry home and take care
of what Mamiya asked me to do.

00:01:46.974 --> 00:01:50.874
But who knew that Mamiya hated mice...

00:01:52.074 --> 00:01:54.204
That's a little unexpected.

00:02:00.214 --> 00:02:02.154
Wh-What's going on?

00:02:07.824 --> 00:02:12.814
Episode 7
Magi? A Maid is Here?

00:02:13.194 --> 00:02:16.824
Um, who might you be?

00:02:21.004 --> 00:02:22.564
Ow...

00:02:24.474 --> 00:02:25.834
A model gun?

00:02:31.144 --> 00:02:33.244
Wh-What was that all about?!

00:02:33.244 --> 00:02:35.304
What's the matter, Big Brother?

00:02:36.054 --> 00:02:39.484
What are you doing? Did you forget your key?

00:02:40.254 --> 00:02:42.554
There's a suspicious person inside the house!

00:02:42.554 --> 00:02:43.864
A suspicious person?

00:02:43.864 --> 00:02:47.964
Oh, let me guess, I bet Ayumi is
up to something again!

00:02:47.964 --> 00:02:49.734
Jeez, what do I do with her?

00:02:49.734 --> 00:02:51.754
Be careful. She's got a gun!

00:02:52.064 --> 00:02:53.304
I'll be fine!

00:02:53.304 --> 00:02:57.134
If she thinks I'll let her take over our house
by force, she's wrong!

00:02:58.104 --> 00:02:59.594
Hey, Ayumi!

00:03:04.814 --> 00:03:06.644
B-Big Sis?!

00:03:07.654 --> 00:03:09.484
Look, guys!

00:03:09.854 --> 00:03:13.944
This must've been made by
compressing air with magic.

00:03:14.294 --> 00:03:17.724
So that means the suspicious person
in there is a witch!

00:03:17.724 --> 00:03:20.164
This is gonna cause a delay in tonight's dinner.

00:03:20.164 --> 00:03:22.394
So this IS Ayumi's doing!

00:03:22.394 --> 00:03:25.524
You tend to blame everything on Ayumi, you know.

00:03:25.764 --> 00:03:29.134
Hey, what are you guys talking about?

00:03:30.344 --> 00:03:32.004
Glare!

00:03:34.714 --> 00:03:36.744
I'm sorry, Big Brother.

00:03:36.744 --> 00:03:39.184
If you were going to apologize,
you shouldn't have beat him to begin with.

00:03:39.244 --> 00:03:40.684
Now let's go!

00:03:40.684 --> 00:03:41.914
I don't know who's in there,

00:03:41.914 --> 00:03:45.624
but we'll show whoever it is the terror of
the three Yoshikawa girls!

00:03:45.624 --> 00:03:47.024
Yeah!

00:03:47.894 --> 00:03:52.294
It seems like the person in there is a witch too,
so don't let your guard down, okay?

00:03:52.294 --> 00:03:54.694
We'll go in on the count of three, got it?

00:03:54.864 --> 00:03:56.294
1...

00:03:56.294 --> 00:03:57.004
2...

00:03:57.004 --> 00:03:57.964
3!

00:03:59.764 --> 00:04:01.234
Gone!

00:04:01.234 --> 00:04:02.564
Did she run away?

00:04:09.014 --> 00:04:12.704
Hey, what do you think you're doing in my house?

00:04:19.584 --> 00:04:22.454
At this rate, the sofa's going to get shredded!

00:04:22.454 --> 00:04:25.964
Where are we supposed to claim the damages
when it's all over?

00:04:25.964 --> 00:04:27.634
We'll counter with guns, too!

00:04:27.634 --> 00:04:28.894
Roger!

00:04:32.104 --> 00:04:36.134
Couldn't you come up with better guns than those?

00:04:36.134 --> 00:04:38.404
At this point it doesn't matter what they look like.

00:04:39.504 --> 00:04:40.664
FIRE!

00:04:47.984 --> 00:04:49.154
She disappeared?!

00:04:49.154 --> 00:04:50.684
What's this?!

00:04:50.684 --> 00:04:56.054
Whoa! Look at how many traps there are!
This is serious!

00:04:56.054 --> 00:05:00.324
It's possible she came looking for Ayumi.

00:05:00.434 --> 00:05:01.464
Oh, I see.

00:05:01.464 --> 00:05:03.604
That's why she set the traps in the kitchen...

00:05:03.604 --> 00:05:08.234
It must be an assassin! A sniper for hire!

00:05:08.534 --> 00:05:12.904
Someone out there with a grudge against Ayumi

00:05:12.904 --> 00:05:15.674
must've sent a lot of money
to a Swiss Bank account!

00:05:15.674 --> 00:05:17.874
Are we up against Duke or what?

00:05:18.514 --> 00:05:21.744
Anyway, we won't know what the motive is
until we catch her, will we?

00:05:22.484 --> 00:05:25.454
It better not be a real assassin...

00:05:28.524 --> 00:05:29.824
Father!

00:05:29.824 --> 00:05:32.024
Father, is it true?

00:05:32.664 --> 00:05:36.924
Is it true that you sent her to the human world?!

00:05:38.564 --> 00:05:42.294
Why, Father? Why did you do such a thing?

00:05:42.804 --> 00:05:45.794
Just what were you thinking?

00:05:46.374 --> 00:05:50.434
She is... She is...

00:06:05.424 --> 00:06:07.834
We're not going to let her do
whatever she pleases anymore!

00:06:07.834 --> 00:06:11.034
We three sisters will exterminate
the enemy with our teamwork!

00:06:11.034 --> 00:06:12.164
Are you ready?

00:06:12.164 --> 00:06:12.934
Good to go!

00:06:12.934 --> 00:06:13.064
Victory is ours!
Good to go!

00:06:13.064 --> 00:06:13.834
Victory is ours!

00:06:13.834 --> 00:06:15.574
All right, here we go!

00:06:15.574 --> 00:06:16.564
Roger!

00:06:22.944 --> 00:06:28.184
Those are mango cakes from the cake house
on Sakuramori 3rd street!

00:06:28.184 --> 00:06:31.484
They're super rare because they make
only twenty of them a day!

00:06:31.484 --> 00:06:35.754
Oh, it must be destiny that I ran into
them at a place like this!

00:06:35.754 --> 00:06:37.814
Thank you for the goodies!

00:06:44.264 --> 00:06:46.294
Stock certificates...

00:06:46.364 --> 00:06:48.474
Hmph, too bad.

00:06:48.474 --> 00:06:52.064
If they'd been advancing stocks,
I would've jumped right on them...

00:06:55.514 --> 00:06:58.384
Looks like I was underestimated.

00:06:58.384 --> 00:07:03.014
If I take this part...
and remove the pin to activate it...

00:07:03.614 --> 00:07:05.624
I... I did it!

00:07:05.624 --> 00:07:07.114
I got a gold bar!

00:07:08.954 --> 00:07:11.184
V-Vibration sensor?!

00:07:18.634 --> 00:07:22.624
Is this... my room?

00:07:23.804 --> 00:07:26.704
Wh-What is this?!
When did I take off my clothes?!

00:07:32.984 --> 00:07:34.214
Who are you?!

00:07:37.554 --> 00:07:39.024
What is this?!

00:07:39.024 --> 00:07:42.094
As long as you don't resist, you won't suffer.

00:07:42.094 --> 00:07:44.054
What do you mean I won't suffer?!

00:07:51.304 --> 00:07:52.794
Big Brother!

00:07:57.104 --> 00:07:59.434
B-Big Brother?

00:07:59.844 --> 00:08:01.144
Big Brother...

00:08:01.144 --> 00:08:02.474
What...

00:08:02.474 --> 00:08:03.474
WHAT DID YOU DO TO BIG BROTHER?!

00:08:03.474 --> 00:08:07.084
*This is an example of how it's used.
WHAT DID YOU DO TO BIG BROTHER?!

00:08:07.084 --> 00:08:08.384
*This is an example of how it's used.

00:08:13.684 --> 00:08:14.294
*This is an example of how it's used.

00:08:14.294 --> 00:08:16.254
*This is an example of how it's used.
YOU WON'T LEAVE HERE ALIVE!

00:08:16.254 --> 00:08:16.744
YOU WON'T LEAVE HERE ALIVE!

00:08:23.264 --> 00:08:25.564
What incredibly strong magical power!

00:08:26.034 --> 00:08:28.294
Just who are you?

00:08:34.944 --> 00:08:37.044
I'm home!

00:08:37.044 --> 00:08:38.414
Haruo!

00:08:41.354 --> 00:08:43.014
Haruo!

00:08:43.014 --> 00:08:46.054
Have you gotten rid of the mice like I asked?

00:08:46.054 --> 00:08:48.114
Ayumi! You have to get out of here!

00:08:55.734 --> 00:08:57.894
What are you doing here?

00:08:59.364 --> 00:09:04.164
I have captured them for you so that you
do not have to trouble Master Haruo.

00:09:09.314 --> 00:09:13.074
GET THEM OUT OF HERE RIGHT NOW!

00:09:14.414 --> 00:09:15.854
So, what?

00:09:15.854 --> 00:09:18.684
You were actually catching rats earlier?

00:09:18.684 --> 00:09:19.784
Yes.

00:09:19.784 --> 00:09:21.794
It is dangerous to be in the house
during the extermination,

00:09:21.794 --> 00:09:26.884
and so I resorted to force in order to
temporarily evacuate all of you to the outside.

00:09:27.694 --> 00:09:28.794
And while I was at it,

00:09:28.794 --> 00:09:33.974
I went ahead and collected data on everyone's
magic powers, battle capabilities and lifestyles.

00:09:33.974 --> 00:09:36.734
Then what were you doing to Big Brother?

00:09:36.734 --> 00:09:40.874
I detected some signs of ill health,

00:09:40.874 --> 00:09:44.584
and so I turned him off temporarily
so that he could rest.

00:09:44.584 --> 00:09:44.984
I'm the one taking care of Big Brother!

00:09:44.984 --> 00:09:48.284
*This is an example of how it's used.
I'm the one taking care of Big Brother!

00:09:48.284 --> 00:09:48.984
*This is an example of how it's used.
Anyway, who are you?

00:09:48.984 --> 00:09:50.504
Anyway, who are you?

00:09:50.924 --> 00:09:52.684
I apologize for not having introduced myself sooner.

00:09:52.684 --> 00:09:53.384
Labor Contract
I apologize for not having introduced myself sooner.

00:09:53.384 --> 00:09:57.024
Labor Contract
I am a maid who was sent here
in support of Lady Ayumi.

00:09:57.024 --> 00:10:00.564
Labor Contract
My name is Rika Anju.
It is a pleasure to meet all of you.

00:10:00.564 --> 00:10:01.534
Labor Contract

00:10:02.334 --> 00:10:05.434
What?! No one told me about this!

00:10:05.434 --> 00:10:07.034
Is that so?

00:10:07.034 --> 00:10:11.544
I was told that all of you like jokes;

00:10:11.544 --> 00:10:15.444
therefore, I tried my best to make this first
entrance unique and interesting.

00:10:15.444 --> 00:10:17.984
Did all of you like it?

00:10:17.984 --> 00:10:20.104
HELL NO!

00:10:20.754 --> 00:10:21.054
Please forgive me.

00:10:21.054 --> 00:10:22.154
What in the world is she doing
in the human world anyway?
Please forgive me.

00:10:22.154 --> 00:10:23.614
What in the world is she doing
in the human world anyway?
I'll be sure to make the next one more interesting.

00:10:23.684 --> 00:10:25.024
Don't you ever do that again!

00:10:25.024 --> 00:10:25.954
And your traps should be more effective,
using the minimum amount of...
If you ever touch my big brother again,

00:10:25.954 --> 00:10:27.284
And your traps should be more effective,
using the minimum amount of...
I'll make sure you regret that you were ever born!

00:10:28.354 --> 00:10:29.094
Haruo?!

00:10:29.094 --> 00:10:30.454
Big Brother?!

00:10:34.764 --> 00:10:37.604
Why did she get sent to the human world?

00:10:37.604 --> 00:10:40.334
She's an elite witch maid.

00:10:40.334 --> 00:10:45.004
At this rate, Haruo Yoshikawa
will end up awakening to it...

00:10:45.004 --> 00:10:47.064
And if that happens, my sister will be...

00:11:06.494 --> 00:11:08.994
Doctor, how is my brother's condition?

00:11:08.994 --> 00:11:09.294
MAKAINO HOSPITAL
Doctor, how is my brother's condition?

00:11:09.294 --> 00:11:12.924
MAKAINO HOSPITAL

00:11:13.204 --> 00:11:17.034
It is definitely a magical fever.

00:11:17.034 --> 00:11:18.504
Magical fever?

00:11:18.504 --> 00:11:21.444
It occurs when the same magic
is cast on you time after time,

00:11:21.444 --> 00:11:24.414
and your body cannot discharge the magic well.

00:11:24.414 --> 00:11:26.674
It is a very dangerous disease.

00:11:26.884 --> 00:11:28.314
Oh, no...

00:11:28.314 --> 00:11:29.954
Go figure...

00:11:29.954 --> 00:11:32.884
He was whacked with the hammer
one too many times.

00:11:32.884 --> 00:11:35.954
I, too, tried to relieve his stress...

00:11:35.954 --> 00:11:38.084
However, I was interrupted in the middle of it.

00:11:41.934 --> 00:11:45.834
What's your problem?
Are you saying it was My fault?!

00:11:45.834 --> 00:11:48.074
What will happen to him if this condition continues?

00:11:48.074 --> 00:11:49.274
At this rate,

00:11:49.274 --> 00:11:54.234
I'm afraid that his body might not be able to
deal with the magical power inside, and fall apart.

00:11:55.944 --> 00:11:57.674
Big Brother...

00:11:57.744 --> 00:12:01.654
But this is the only magic hospital
in the human world!

00:12:01.654 --> 00:12:04.324
There are ways to treat it, aren't there?

00:12:04.324 --> 00:12:06.484
Tonight will be crucial.

00:12:06.484 --> 00:12:07.684
You don't mean...

00:12:10.824 --> 00:12:14.224
Why... Haruo...

00:12:17.194 --> 00:12:23.904
MAKAINO HOSPITAL

00:12:25.544 --> 00:12:27.914
You guys are totally overreacting!

00:12:27.914 --> 00:12:31.044
Look! As you can see, I feel just fine!

00:12:31.044 --> 00:12:34.314
I feel so great it's like nothing ever
happened yesterday!

00:12:34.314 --> 00:12:36.284
What was that about...

00:12:36.284 --> 00:12:38.354
I was worried for nothing...

00:12:38.354 --> 00:12:39.544
YOU!

00:12:40.224 --> 00:12:42.494
I thought you told us that last night was crucial!

00:12:42.494 --> 00:12:45.924
It's just that he managed to get over it!
I thought you told us that last night was crucial!

00:12:46.094 --> 00:12:46.694
MAKAINO HOSPITAL

00:12:46.694 --> 00:12:49.164
MAKAINO HOSPITAL
You're a quack!

00:12:49.164 --> 00:12:49.654
MAKAINO HOSPITAL

00:12:52.034 --> 00:12:53.634
Thank goodness!

00:12:53.634 --> 00:12:57.074
I'm so glad that my brother's condition
isn't that bad.

00:12:57.074 --> 00:13:01.974
Lady Maika, I shall take over and
look after Master Haruo now,

00:13:01.974 --> 00:13:04.744
so please, all of you go home and get some rest.

00:13:04.744 --> 00:13:07.184
No, I'm going to stay right by my brother.

00:13:07.184 --> 00:13:08.274
You got a problem with that?

00:13:10.214 --> 00:13:12.554
Just like I thought, you are exhausted.

00:13:12.554 --> 00:13:14.954
Do not strain yourself. Please go home and relax.

00:13:15.354 --> 00:13:18.094
Okay, take care of the rest for us!

00:13:18.094 --> 00:13:19.784
Take care...

00:13:21.734 --> 00:13:23.134
You got a minute?

00:13:24.534 --> 00:13:30.604
I don't know what my father told you,
but I have my own plan.

00:13:30.604 --> 00:13:33.244
So I'd appreciate it if you stayed out of my way!

00:13:33.244 --> 00:13:38.444
I was ordered to assist you and take care of you,

00:13:38.444 --> 00:13:40.934
and I am here to do just that.

00:13:41.014 --> 00:13:43.854
I'm going to take care of Haruo!

00:13:43.854 --> 00:13:45.824
So don't get in my way!

00:13:45.984 --> 00:13:48.994
My current master is Master Haruo.

00:13:48.994 --> 00:13:51.084
Taking care of him is my duty.

00:13:54.634 --> 00:13:57.604
You're as hardheaded as always, aren't you?

00:13:57.604 --> 00:14:00.434
So you'll comply as long as it's Haruo
doing the asking, right?

00:14:00.434 --> 00:14:01.664
Of course.

00:14:02.434 --> 00:14:05.704
Fine. Then let's ask Haruo to decide.

00:14:06.274 --> 00:14:09.934
You or me... Who does he want
to be taken care of by?

00:14:10.244 --> 00:14:11.234
MAID FIGHT
SERVICE
BATTLE!!

00:14:12.314 --> 00:14:14.804
HA... RU... O!

00:14:18.324 --> 00:14:21.654
Haruo, you haven't bathed, right?

00:14:21.654 --> 00:14:24.254
I'll wipe you down, okay?

00:14:26.924 --> 00:14:28.694
Hey, does it feel good?

00:14:28.694 --> 00:14:30.224
Y-Yeah...

00:14:31.564 --> 00:14:35.404
All I gotta do is be a little sweet to him.
That's all it takes to get Haruo!

00:14:35.704 --> 00:14:37.134
Excuse me.

00:14:38.874 --> 00:14:43.044
Master Haruo, would you like a massage?

00:14:43.044 --> 00:14:47.744
Accumulated fatigue could cause
a stress-related illness again.

00:14:48.154 --> 00:14:50.824
What, you said massage?

00:14:50.824 --> 00:14:55.094
H-Hey, can't you see I'm in the middle of
wiping Haruo's body down?

00:14:55.094 --> 00:14:56.954
Don't interrupt me!

00:14:56.954 --> 00:14:59.624
But it is Master Haruo who will make the decision.

00:14:59.924 --> 00:15:02.964
Haruo is fine as long as I'm with him,
isn't that right?

00:15:02.964 --> 00:15:06.264
Yeah, but since she's offering
I guess I'll take her up on it.

00:15:08.874 --> 00:15:10.834
Healing magic.

00:15:14.944 --> 00:15:19.044
I've never had a massage this good before.

00:15:19.744 --> 00:15:22.354
To hell with that!
Mine feels so much better, doesn't it?

00:15:22.354 --> 00:15:24.524
Pick me, damn it!

00:15:24.524 --> 00:15:25.954
Yeow!

00:15:27.224 --> 00:15:30.524
What? Pick? What does she mean by that?

00:15:31.264 --> 00:15:34.024
That damn Rika... What the hell is she thinking?

00:15:34.024 --> 00:15:35.324
Now that it's come down to this...

00:15:40.904 --> 00:15:41.694
Grin...

00:15:47.474 --> 00:15:48.874
Why you!

00:15:48.874 --> 00:15:52.684
You have some nerve, messing with ME!

00:15:52.684 --> 00:15:57.084
But it was you who started it,
was it not, Lady Ayumi?

00:15:57.084 --> 00:15:59.174
No arguments!

00:16:01.494 --> 00:16:02.884
Fine, then take this!

00:16:06.394 --> 00:16:06.864
Eel?

00:16:06.864 --> 00:16:08.694
Eel, eel, eel...

00:16:08.694 --> 00:16:11.064
EEL!

00:16:11.064 --> 00:16:13.834
Wh-What's going on?

00:16:13.834 --> 00:16:14.934
Do I still have a fever?

00:16:14.934 --> 00:16:16.734
It's so slimy!
Do I still have a fever?

00:16:16.734 --> 00:16:18.444
No, no, stop it! Oh, not right there!
M-Mamiya?

00:16:18.444 --> 00:16:20.374
No, no, stop it! Oh, not right there!

00:16:20.374 --> 00:16:21.804
Choice, confirmed.

00:16:23.274 --> 00:16:26.334
I will now turn it over to Lady Ayumi.

00:16:43.364 --> 00:16:48.354
Sweet potato! Sweet potato!
You're so sweet, sweet potato!

00:16:48.734 --> 00:16:51.034
ROASTED
SWEET
POTATO

00:16:53.174 --> 00:16:53.974
Huh?

00:16:55.144 --> 00:16:58.044
It's a pinch. Here comes my punch. Ya.

00:17:04.624 --> 00:17:06.784
So Haruo ended up picking me!

00:17:06.784 --> 00:17:09.154
I guess that's a sign of him being
a little manlier than before!

00:17:09.224 --> 00:17:11.854
Maybe I should give him
a little reward or something!

00:17:11.924 --> 00:17:12.954
Huh?

00:17:15.134 --> 00:17:16.964
Now that I think about it,

00:17:16.964 --> 00:17:19.904
he's forgotten about the kiss
he had with me, hasn't he?

00:17:20.934 --> 00:17:21.834
Hey!

00:17:21.834 --> 00:17:22.674
Haruo!

00:17:22.674 --> 00:17:24.194
Huh? What's up?

00:17:28.214 --> 00:17:29.404
Mamiya?!

00:17:29.644 --> 00:17:32.184
We can, can't we?

00:17:32.184 --> 00:17:33.644
Huh? What?

00:17:38.354 --> 00:17:42.194
Damn! He came so close to awakening as a man!

00:17:42.194 --> 00:17:43.554
Mamiya!

00:17:43.854 --> 00:17:45.964
Reprehensible conduct against Yoshikawa!

00:17:45.964 --> 00:17:48.564
Your action violates Article 303
of the student council regulations!

00:17:48.564 --> 00:17:52.264
How dare you make Yoshikawa ill of all things?

00:17:52.264 --> 00:17:54.974
You've finally shown your true colors as a witch!

00:17:54.974 --> 00:17:57.134
Kurosu and Nijihara...

00:17:57.134 --> 00:18:01.404
That's funny, it feels like this has
happened to me before.

00:18:01.774 --> 00:18:03.834
Maybe I do still have a fever...

00:18:04.074 --> 00:18:05.714
You perverted wench!

00:18:05.714 --> 00:18:07.784
I'm going to bring this to an end right now!

00:18:07.784 --> 00:18:10.984
You evil witch who seduces
the Holy Being Yoshikawa!

00:18:10.984 --> 00:18:12.254
Say your prayers!

00:18:12.254 --> 00:18:15.254
And FYI, you're next!

00:18:15.254 --> 00:18:16.524
What did you say?!

00:18:16.524 --> 00:18:19.824
You do this every single time!
You don't know when to stop, do you?

00:18:28.604 --> 00:18:30.034
What was that?

00:18:30.034 --> 00:18:32.094
What happened just now?

00:18:32.344 --> 00:18:35.844
I must be dreaming!

00:18:35.844 --> 00:18:37.474
We've got a problem.

00:18:37.944 --> 00:18:43.514
Firdene, the fire spirit which was sealed into this
hospital a long time ago, has escaped.

00:18:43.514 --> 00:18:46.784
Firdene? Why this hospital?

00:18:46.784 --> 00:18:50.594
This isn't good! That spirit is way out of our league!

00:18:50.594 --> 00:18:53.664
She must be using it to
try to eliminate me and Senior!

00:18:53.664 --> 00:18:58.124
Not only that, if this keeps up
it'll end up eliminating all of us!

00:19:06.004 --> 00:19:07.374
What incredible magical power!

00:19:07.374 --> 00:19:09.074
What wicked power!

00:19:09.074 --> 00:19:11.414
This is bad! What are we going to do?

00:19:11.414 --> 00:19:14.144
What are we going to do?
Obviously we have no choice but to fight it!

00:19:14.144 --> 00:19:15.944
Here we go!

00:19:36.504 --> 00:19:37.674
Haruo!

00:19:37.674 --> 00:19:40.244
We're not going to get anywhere if we
keep on attacking it separately!

00:19:40.244 --> 00:19:42.274
It's gonna regenerate itself again!

00:19:42.274 --> 00:19:43.314
Guys!

00:19:43.314 --> 00:19:46.984
Try to focus your wicked witch powers on my spear!

00:19:46.984 --> 00:19:50.284
You're totally annoying me, saying "wicked this"
and "evil that" every time you open your mouth!

00:19:50.284 --> 00:19:51.654
This is no time for an argument!

00:19:52.924 --> 00:19:56.054
I'm a descendant of a family
that's responsible for purifying evil!

00:19:56.054 --> 00:20:00.964
In the name of the absolute Lord,
I put thee under seal!

00:20:06.634 --> 00:20:08.034
Damn, it's not working!

00:20:08.034 --> 00:20:11.664
What's up with your stupid spear?
It's completely useless!

00:20:12.304 --> 00:20:13.564
Hey, look at that!

00:20:16.114 --> 00:20:18.074
Oh, no! Haruo!

00:20:22.654 --> 00:20:24.584
What do you think you're doing?!

00:20:24.584 --> 00:20:25.654
I don't care anymore!

00:20:25.654 --> 00:20:28.144
I'm going to protect Senior no matter what,
even if it costs my own life!

00:20:28.854 --> 00:20:29.694
Stop it!

00:20:29.694 --> 00:20:31.384
It's gonna burn even your soul!

00:20:31.964 --> 00:20:33.454
I don't care!

00:20:37.904 --> 00:20:39.334
You two...

00:20:39.334 --> 00:20:42.204
I'm not gonna let you steal the show!

00:20:42.204 --> 00:20:45.364
My desire to protect Yoshikawa
is much greater than yours!

00:20:54.284 --> 00:20:56.344
Ladies, that was magnificent.

00:20:56.854 --> 00:20:59.384
It is a pleasure to meet you,
Lady Yuri and Lady Marin.

00:20:59.384 --> 00:21:04.924
My name is Rika Anju, and I shall be
serving the Yoshikawa family.

00:21:04.924 --> 00:21:10.034
I have used this opportunity to introduce myself
as well as to collect battle data on both of you.

00:21:10.034 --> 00:21:11.904
What did you just say?!

00:21:11.904 --> 00:21:13.994
Don't tell me you just...

00:21:14.434 --> 00:21:18.244
I was told that all of you like jokes.

00:21:18.244 --> 00:21:22.104
Did you all enjoy the event that
I put together for you?

00:21:22.414 --> 00:21:24.344
You wish!

00:21:25.084 --> 00:21:25.844
So that means you're a wicked witch too?!

00:21:25.844 --> 00:21:28.314
So that means you're a wicked witch too?!
Seriously, she's such a hardhead...

00:21:28.314 --> 00:21:29.544
Prepare yourself!
Seriously, she's such a hardhead...

00:21:31.014 --> 00:21:32.114
It's me, Haruo.

00:21:32.684 --> 00:21:36.554
Well then, ladies, I shall take my leave.

00:21:36.924 --> 00:21:38.354
GET OUT OF HERE ALREADY!

00:21:42.964 --> 00:21:44.664
I knew you'd come.

00:21:47.004 --> 00:21:50.574
Just standing there watching
will not change a thing.

00:21:50.574 --> 00:21:53.044
The same thing will just end up repeating.

00:21:57.014 --> 00:21:59.714
Hmph. Repeating, huh?

00:21:59.714 --> 00:22:05.114
But what would you do if I told you
that you're repeating the same things, too?

00:22:10.494 --> 00:22:13.484
MAGIKANO

00:22:20.004 --> 00:22:26.404
This is a secret, but I am a little different

00:22:26.404 --> 00:22:32.614
Do I look ordinary or cute? Yeah! Yeah!

00:22:32.614 --> 00:22:36.084
I know I'm mellow and mediocre

00:22:36.084 --> 00:22:39.154
But so what? So what?

00:22:39.154 --> 00:22:42.254
But just as I was thinking that

00:22:42.254 --> 00:22:45.624
I got myself mixed up in trouble

00:22:45.624 --> 00:22:48.634
I'm not going to lose, I'm not going to give you up

00:22:48.634 --> 00:22:51.934
Because you are precious to me

00:22:51.934 --> 00:22:58.464
Maybe I should not cast a spell

00:22:59.904 --> 00:23:03.174
I don't want magic to be

00:23:03.174 --> 00:23:06.314
The reason why it's this way

00:23:06.314 --> 00:23:12.854
When it comes to love, it has to be real

00:23:12.854 --> 00:23:19.264
Who are you in love with?

00:23:19.264 --> 00:23:25.434
Everyone is dying to know the answer!

00:23:25.434 --> 00:23:28.734
Seriously, I have to guard you
from the love scramble that is about to begin

00:23:28.734 --> 00:23:30.204
It's a pinch! Here comes my punch!

00:23:39.184 --> 00:23:40.514
Fall is here!

00:23:40.514 --> 00:23:44.954
I see Ayumi and Yuri blazing through the flame;
this is no longer an ordinary school sports day!

00:23:46.554 --> 00:23:49.084
Is this simply the fate of being a witch?

00:23:49.254 --> 00:23:53.454
Now Michiru's evil magical power has begun
to shroud all of Sakuramori Academy!

00:23:54.734 --> 00:23:58.564
Next time on Magikano:
"Magi? A Victory Kiss?"

00:24:00.104 --> 00:24:03.934
Are you confident that you can Magikano?
